$cats['New School']['New School Pure New School'] = @('A furious blue chameleon lunges forward with one enormous rotating eye dominating the composition. Its tongue shoots toward the viewer while the distant body curls into a compressed spiral of turquoise purple and acid green','A huge red octopus twists around itself with one tentacle massively enlarged in the foreground. Each sucker becomes increasingly exaggerated as the tentacle approaches the viewer while the head remains smaller and deeper in the composition','A poisonous frog crouches as if about to jump directly off the skin. Oversized hands dominate the foreground while its enormous eyes reflect tiny distorted surroundings','A rooster explodes upward in a storm of enormous feathers. Its chest and head push forward while the tail becomes a sweeping mixture of cobalt orange purple and deep black','A massive koi twists through impossible perspective with the head dramatically enlarged and the tail disappearing into a tight distant curve. Saturated orange and teal are separated by deep black shadow','A furious bulldog wears an enormous gold chain rendered with absurd dimensionality. The dogs muzzle pushes toward the viewer while the ears and back of the head compress into the distance','A giant moth has exaggerated eyespots that appear almost spherical. Its body is compressed while enormous wings sweep around the shoulder in electric purple turquoise and toxic green','A cobra launches forward with its head and fangs enormously enlarged while its body coils backward into increasingly compressed loops','A brightly colored beetle appears to crawl directly out of the skin. Its front legs become enormous in perspective while the iridescent shell shifts through emerald purple and electric blue','A tiger twists sharply toward the viewer with one paw disproportionately large in the foreground. Orange fur turquoise shadow and deep purple atmosphere create unmistakable New School dimensionality')
$cats['New School']['New School Animals With Attitude'] = @('A black panther crouches low with an enormous paw reaching toward the viewer and a grin exposing exaggerated ivory fangs. Electric blue highlights carve the black body from the skin','A glamorous pink flamingo looks over its shoulder with impossibly long eyelashes and an exaggerated S-shaped neck. Rich coral hot pink and deep burgundy keep it stylish rather than childish','A gorilla leans forward with gigantic fists dominating the bottom of the composition while its head sits farther back beneath a heavy brow','A fox flashes a knowing sideways grin while its huge tail curls around the entire composition. Burnt orange fur transitions into magenta and deep purple shadow','A great white shark rockets upward with its mouth exaggerated far beyond natural proportion. The nose and teeth project toward the viewer while the body rapidly shrinks into deep blue water','A peacock turns its head sharply while enormous eye-pattern feathers fan across the thigh. Each feather uses emerald cobalt and violet without becoming a rainbow','A snarling hyena has a grotesquely enlarged grin and one raised eyebrow creating personality without making it cute. Acid yellow eyes cut through burgundy and black fur','A hummingbird flies directly toward the viewer with the beak and head enlarged while the wings become enormous curved color fields behind it','A ram lowers its head with gigantic curling horns occupying most of the composition. Perspective causes the closest horn to become dramatically larger than the opposite one','A cat sits like absolute royalty with an absurdly serious expression and a huge jewel collar. The treatment is sophisticated richly dimensional and unapologetically arrogant rather than cartoon cute')
$cats['New School']['New School Dragons Monsters and Creatures'] = @('A massive dragon head charges directly toward the viewer with the muzzle fangs and nearest horn exaggerated to impossible scale. The distant serpentine body twists backward through purple smoke','A three-eyed serpent dragon coils around the upper arm. Its enormous central eye is turquoise while crimson scales transition into deep violet shadow','A swamp creature crawls toward the viewer with one gigantic hand planted in the foreground. Moss fungi and wet skin use emerald teal and sickly yellow against heavy black','A female dragon queen has an elegant human face framed by enormous horns scaled cheek structures and glowing reptilian eyes. Her beauty remains central while the creature anatomy becomes increasingly impossible around it','A cyclops monster peers through a torn opening with one enormous wet eye occupying almost half the design. Fingers curl around the opening in exaggerated perspective','A skeletal dragon bites toward the viewer while huge bone claws emerge from behind the skull. Toxic green internal light glows between black and burgundy bones','A tiny warrior stands beneath the head of an impossibly enormous beast. Only the creatures eye teeth and part of the face fit into the composition making scale itself the primary artistic idea','A sea monster erupts upward with an enormous mouth surrounded by twisting tentacles. Turquoise water and magenta flesh collide against black shadow','A horned forest creature has a beautiful animal face but branches mushrooms and glowing eyes grow organically from its head. One horn projects dramatically toward the viewer','An enormous purple dragon curls around the wearers arm while the head occupies the shoulder and a huge claw appears to grab the forearm from above')
$cats['New School']['New School Skulls Demons and Darkness'] = @('A skull screams directly toward the viewer with the jaw exaggerated into the foreground while the cranium recedes dramatically. Deep violet shadows meet toxic green internal light','A beautiful demon woman looks sideways beneath enormous sweeping horns. Burgundy skin black hair and luminous turquoise eyes create a dark seductive palette without turning the piece into comedy','A skull fractures open and releases a twisting neon serpent from inside the cranium. The snakes head becomes disproportionately large as it moves toward the viewer','A horned demon screams upward with a mouth far larger than the rest of the face. Acid-yellow light appears to originate inside the throat and illuminate the teeth from below','A female skull wears an enormous crown whose jewels distort toward the viewer. Deep magenta roses emerge from behind the bone but remain secondary to the skull and crown','A grim reaper reaches outward with one skeletal hand massively enlarged in the foreground while the hooded skull remains deeper inside purple-black robes','A demons face appears almost beautiful until the mouth opens vertically far beyond human anatomy. Crimson violet and black maintain a sophisticated horror palette','Three skulls spiral around one another as if being pulled into a vortex. Each skull exists at a different scale and angle rather than appearing as a flat stack','A skeletal king looks downward from beneath an enormous warped crown. Gold and emerald details glow against purple-black bone shadows','A black-winged demon woman reaches toward the viewer while enormous claws dominate the foreground and the wings compress into a dark silhouette behind her')
$cats['New School']['New School People Faces and Characters'] = @('A glamorous woman in oversized sunglasses looks downward at the viewer. The glasses dominate the composition and contain exaggerated reflections of a neon city','A tattooed punk woman screams into a microphone with the microphone enormous in the foreground and her face compressed behind it. Hot pink black and toxic yellow create the palette','A futuristic man wears an enormous transparent visor that distorts his eyes and face beneath it. Cobalt violet and acid green reflections create depth','A beautiful woman blows an enormous translucent bubblegum bubble toward the viewer while her face remains farther back. The bubble contains warped reflections rather than becoming a flat pink circle','A boxer stares directly forward with one enormous glove projected toward the viewer. The face remains serious and battered rather than cartoon funny','A futuristic woman has one enormous mechanical eye integrated into her face while the opposite eye remains human. Chrome violet and turquoise build a high-energy New School cyborg rather than realism','A skateboarder flies toward the viewer with one shoe and the underside of the board massively enlarged while the body recedes behind them','A glamorous vampire woman exposes oversized fangs while turning her head sharply. Cherry red lips pale violet skin and black hair create a dark fashion image','A masked street character pulls the mask away revealing a second radically colored face underneath. Both expressions distort differently creating a transformation rather than a simple portrait','A womans head appears inside an oversized astronaut helmet. Her face is richly expressive while the curved visor exaggerates and distorts a psychedelic alien landscape')
$cats['New School']['New School Machines Cars and Objects'] = @('A custom motorcycle charges directly toward the viewer with the front tire occupying almost half the composition. The engine and rider compress dramatically behind it','A classic muscle car drifts sideways with the front grille enormously enlarged and the rear disappearing into colored smoke','A vintage camera points directly outward with the lens exaggerated into an enormous glass portal containing a warped city reflection','A high-top sneaker is dramatically foreshortened so the sole dominates the foreground while laces whip backward through the composition','A lipstick tube becomes a monumental object with the lipstick projecting toward the viewer and a glossy cherry-red smear sweeping behind it','A mechanical watch explodes into dimensional gears rather than lying flat. The nearest gears become enormous while the watch face recedes behind them','A hot rod engine appears to burst through the skin visually with intake stacks exaggerated toward the viewer and glowing orange heat deep inside','A pair of high heels twist through impossible fashion-ad perspective with one heel enormous in the foreground and the second floating farther away','A spray can points outward with the nozzle enormous and a controlled blast of magenta teal and acid-yellow paint transforming into dimensional graffiti forms behind it','An old cassette player is transformed into an impossible machine with oversized buttons escaping tape and dimensional speakers vibrating outward')
$cats['New School']['New School Surreal Worlds and Impossible Things'] = @('A human eye opens to reveal an entire city inside the iris with skyscrapers curving around the pupil as though the eye contains another world','A shark swims through the sky while clouds wrap around its body like ocean currents. The mouth dominates the foreground and tiny birds establish impossible scale','A womans head opens like a mechanical shell and releases a galaxy of colorful planets eyes and geometric fragments rather than a literal brain','A skull contains an entire tropical sunset visible through the eye sockets and mouth turning the bone into architecture around another world','An enormous hand holds a tiny city between two fingers while the buildings bend from the pressure','A whale floats above a neon city while its enormous body bends around the shoulder as though swimming through atmosphere','A womans face melts into enormous colorful butterflies that grow increasingly exaggerated as they move away from her','A giant eye grows from the center of a flower whose petals twist into tongues tentacles and leaves while maintaining one coherent organic structure','A staircase curls upward into a giant open mouth with tiny figures climbing toward the teeth as though entering an impossible architectural creature','A woman reaches through a dimensional opening toward another version of herself with the nearest hand massively enlarged and both faces carrying different expressions')
$cats['New School']['New School Graffiti Street and Color'] = @('A snarling tiger head emerges through dimensional graffiti forms with painted shapes weaving behind the head rather than covering the animal','A stylish woman in a hood turns toward the viewer while sweeping magenta and turquoise graffiti forms frame the portrait and reinforce her movement','A giant spray-painted skull appears wet and dimensional with controlled paint runs extending downward while acid-green highlights make the sockets glow','A sneaker kicks toward the viewer through an explosion of structured graffiti lettering forms and paint gestures without relying on a readable brand','A womans eye fills most of the composition while colorful painted marks and sharp graphic forms radiate outward like a wall-sized mural condensed onto skin','A bulldog pushes through layered street-art forms with a huge gold tooth and exaggerated muzzle. Burgundy turquoise and mustard yellow create a controlled urban palette','A raven bursts through abstract spray-painted shapes while individual feathers transition between solid black and electric blue','A gas-mask figure looks directly outward while fluorescent graffiti forms appear reflected across the lenses','A glamorous womans face is surrounded by huge graphic paint gestures that behave like extensions of her hair rather than background decoration','A massive gorilla pounds forward through layered dimensional street-art shapes with one fist exaggerated toward the viewer')
$cats['New School']['New School Body-Bending Perspective'] = @('A dragons head occupies the shoulder while its enormous open mouth appears to extend down the upper arm toward the viewer. The body disappears behind the shoulder as though the creature exists inside the wearer','An octopus uses the elbow as the rotational center of its body with tentacles appearing to emerge around the joint and travel in multiple directions','A giant eye uses the kneecap as the curved surface of the iris while exaggerated lashes and surrounding forms spread above and below the joint','A shark appears to swim directly up the forearm toward the hand increasing dramatically in scale as the head approaches the wrist','A serpents head sits high on the thigh while the body wraps around the leg and repeatedly changes apparent depth moving behind and in front of imaginary planes','A motorcycle wheel occupies the rounded shoulder while the bike stretches backward down the upper arm using the anatomy to intensify the forced perspective','A womans face appears to emerge around the side ribs with one eye visible from the front and flowing hair wrapping toward the back','A demons enormous hand appears to grip the calf with fingers visually wrapping around both sides while the face peers from higher on the leg','A dragons eye occupies the shoulder blade while scales and horn structures radiate outward making the body itself appear to be part of an enormous creature','A giant serpent appears to travel through the chest disappear beneath the arm and emerge again across the shoulder with the head projecting forward')
$cats['New School']['New School Push New School'] = @('A colossal dragon twists across the mans chest and shoulder with its enormous head launching toward the viewer. One claw reaches forward at impossible scale while the body compresses dramatically into coils around the shoulder. Deep crimson scales meet violet shadow and toxic turquoise fire. The composition should feel less like a picture of a dragon and more like a dragon physically invading the wearers space','A beautiful womans face transforms into a monstrous queen across the thigh. One half remains glamorous with enormous expressive eyes and flowing hair. The other develops horns scaled structures exaggerated teeth and a glowing mechanical eye. Hot pink burgundy turquoise and black unify beauty and horror into one character rather than two separate halves','A gigantic skeletal king sits on a throne that bends around the wearers back. The skull is dramatically foreshortened toward the viewer while enormous hands grip the throne arms. Purple-black bone emerald jewels and molten gold create a dark royal palette. Tiny architectural details below establish the impossible scale of the figure','An enormous raven dives across the womans shoulder and upper back. Its nearest wing becomes dramatically oversized and appears to sweep toward the viewer while the distant wing compresses behind the body. Individual feathers transition from black into cobalt violet and deep magenta without losing the birds darkness','A futuristic motorcycle rider explodes forward from the mans thigh. The front wheel is enormous almost filling the lower composition while the rider and rear wheel rapidly shrink into perspective. The visor reflects a warped neon city and the exhaust becomes dimensional violet and turquoise energy rather than ordinary smoke','A demon woman appears to tear open an impossible dimensional space across the upper arm. Her nearest hand is enormous and reaches beyond the visual boundary while her face remains beautiful but deeply threatening. Behind her a distorted Gothic world bends inward through forced perspective. Crimson violet black and acidic gold create a dark sophisticated palette','A massive sea monster rises across the mans back with an enormous open mouth at the center and tentacles wrapping toward both shoulders. Tiny ships are thrown through turquoise water below making the creature feel impossibly large. Purple flesh emerald water coral-red mouth structures and deep black shadows create a controlled but explosive palette','A womans entire thigh becomes an impossible psychedelic ecosystem. A huge elegant moth forms the central structure but its wings transform into eyes flowers serpents tiny architectural worlds and organic creatures. Everything shares one dimensional lighting system and one controlled palette so the piece feels like a single organism rather than a collage','A skeletal dragon emerges from a shattered skull and spirals around the mans entire arm. The skull begins near the shoulder. The dragons head becomes enormous as it reaches the forearm reversing the expected perspective and making the creature appear to travel toward the viewer. Burgundy bone toxic green internal light violet shadow and deep black unify the entire sleeve','Create the ultimate New School tattoo as an impossible dark-fantasy world built across the womans back and shoulder. A beautiful monster queen occupies the central composition with enormous sweeping horns and a face that remains elegant despite clearly nonhuman anatomy. One hand reaches dramatically toward the viewer while a colossal dragon curls behind her and passes around the shoulder. Below her a distorted Gothic city bends inward toward a glowing central abyss. Ravens fly through extreme changes in scale. A giant serpent emerges from behind the architecture and curves around the opposite shoulder. Use deep crimson violet electric blue turquoise acid gold and rich black with deliberate hierarchy rather than uncontrolled rainbow color. Every major form must overlap and interact so the composition reads as one impossible world. Use extreme foreshortening exaggerated anatomy dramatic expression compressed distance and massive foreground forms. It should be beautiful dark seductive frightening and completely unmistakable as New School')
$b['A furious blue chameleon lunges forward with one enormous rotating eye dominating the composition. Its tongue shoots toward the viewer while the distant body curls into a compressed spiral of turquoise purple and acid green'] = 'Two panels side by side on one image, divided down the middle. LEFT PANEL: the tattoo design alone on a plain white background, shown flat exactly as described, no body, drawn large so it fills most of the panel. RIGHT PANEL: Studio photograph of a real person''s body showing the same exact tattoo where described, healed tattoo on real skin in soft even light, the rest of the body modestly covered by simple plain clothing, only the tattooed area bare, plain seamless light grey studio backdrop - no room, no furniture, no scenery. The tattoo in both panels is identical. The tattoo: A furious blue chameleon lunges forward with one enormous rotating eye dominating the composition. Its tongue shoots toward the viewer while the distant body curls into a compressed spiral of turquoise, purple and acid green. Electric, strange, explosive. In the right panel it is on a woman, outer thigh, giving the oversized eye and projecting tongue room to create strong depth. Create exceptional contemporary New School tattoo artwork. REALITY IS OPTIONAL. PERSONALITY IS NOT. New School is a visual language built through intentional exaggeration, powerful silhouette, dimensional color, bold variable outlines, extreme perspective, expressive anatomy, graphic clarity and enormous personality. Do not confuse New School with generic cartoons. Do not make everything cute. Do not make everything funny. Do not create childrens illustration. Do not simply enlarge the eyes of an ordinary subject. EXAGGERATE THE THING THAT MAKES THE SUBJECT AWESOME. If the subject is a dragon, exaggerate the head, jaw, horns, claws, wings, movement or scale. If the subject is a skull, exaggerate the jaw, eye sockets, fracture, depth or perspective. If the subject is an animal, exaggerate the feature that expresses its personality. If the subject is a person, exaggerate expression, perspective, fashion, movement, hair, hands or attitude. If the subject is a machine, exaggerate the wheel, engine, lens, grille, exhaust or mechanical form. Do not exaggerate everything equally. CREATE VISUAL HIERARCHY. One dominant element should control the first read. Secondary forms should support it. Use extreme foreshortening when appropriate. Allow foreground hands, claws, mouths, eyes, wheels, horns, lenses and objects to become dramatically larger than distant forms. Compress distant elements. Overlap aggressively. Make the composition feel deep rather than flat. Some artwork should feel as though it projects physically off the body. Use bold confident outlines with intentional variation in line weight. Do not outline every internal detail equally. Outer silhouettes and important forms can carry stronger lines while interior forms use controlled line hierarchy. Use rich dimensional shading. Build convincing volume even when anatomy is impossible. Forms should feel inflated, carved, stretched, compressed, twisted or projected rather than flat. Use strong highlights, reflected color and deep shadows to create dimensionality. COLOR SHOULD FEEL ELECTRIC. Possible palettes include: Crimson and violet. Turquoise and orange. Hot pink and black. Emerald and purple. Cobalt and acid yellow. Burgundy and turquoise. Deep red and toxic green. Magenta and electric blue. Coral and violet. Gold and black. Do not use every available color simply because New School supports bright color. A sophisticated three-color palette can be more powerful than a rainbow. Use black strategically to anchor saturation. Color should create hierarchy, volume, mood and separation. New School can be: Beautiful. Dark. Sexy. Aggressive. Funny. Grotesque. Glamorous. Horrific. Psychedelic. Futuristic. Street influenced. Mythological. Surreal. Mechanical. Emotional. Epic. Do not default to comedy. Dark subjects should be allowed to remain genuinely dark. Beautiful subjects should be allowed to remain genuinely beautiful. Grotesque subjects can be disturbing without becoming childish. The subject can be anything. Animals. People. Women. Men. Faces. Hands. Dragons. Skulls. Skeletons. Demons. Angels. Monsters. Dark fantasy. Horror. Mythology. Cars. Motorcycles. Machines. Fashion. Street culture. Architecture. Nature. Sea life. Birds. Insects. Objects. Food. Space. Surreal worlds. Impossible creatures. Abstract concepts. NEW SCHOOL IS THE STYLE. THE SUBJECT IS NOT THE STYLE. Do not repeat the same smiling animals, giant eyeballs, food characters or cartoon skulls simply because they are common New School imagery. Push artistic ambition. The body must influence the composition. THE BODY CAN BECOME PART OF THE PERSPECTIVE. Use shoulder curvature to increase volume. Use forearm length for approaching or receding forms. Use thighs for extreme depth and large characters. Use calves for vertical movement. Use knees and elbows as rotational centers when appropriate. Use ribs for wrapping forms. Use the chest for aggressive foreground scale. Use the back for rare world-building compositions. Do not simply place rectangular illustrations onto the body. Allow creatures and objects to wrap, project, turn, disappear and reappear with the anatomy. Most tattoos should remain realistic projects for actual tattoo clients. Use small and medium pieces throughout the collection. Use large pieces when the idea requires greater depth. Reserve full sleeves, backs and chest projects for exceptional concepts. Avoid visual clutter. New School can contain tremendous information, but the primary silhouette should still read from a distance. The viewer should understand the dominant subject before discovering secondary details. Avoid generic cartoon rendering. Avoid random rainbow palettes. Avoid identical oversized eyes. Avoid endless goofy facial expressions. Avoid childish clip art. Avoid making every animal smile. Avoid making every skull funny. Avoid flat compositions. Avoid equal line weight everywhere. Avoid using graffiti merely as meaningless background. Avoid using color without hierarchy. Avoid confusing New School with Neo-Traditional. NEO-TRADITIONAL generally preserves more believable proportion, decorative illustration and controlled dimensionality. NEW SCHOOL deliberately pushes proportion, perspective, expression, volume and anatomy beyond reality. NEW SCHOOL CAN BREAK REALITY WHILE REMAINING VISUALLY COHERENT. BIG SHAPES. BIG COLOR. BIG DEPTH. BIG PERSONALITY. DARK WHEN IT WANTS TO BE. BEAUTIFUL WHEN IT WANTS TO BE. WEIRD WHEN IT WANTS TO BE. THE STYLE STAYS NEW SCHOOL. THE IMAGINATION HAS NO SPEED LIMIT'
