ional. NEO-TRADITIONAL generally preserves more believable proportion, decorative illustration and controlled dimensionality. NEW SCHOOL deliberately pushes proportion, perspective, expression, volume and anatomy beyond reality. NEW SCHOOL CAN BREAK REALITY WHILE REMAINING VISUALLY COHERENT. BIG SHAPES. BIG COLOR. BIG DEPTH. BIG PERSONALITY. DARK WHEN IT WANTS TO BE. BEAUTIFUL WHEN IT WANTS TO BE. WEIRD WHEN IT WANTS TO BE. THE STYLE STAYS NEW SCHOOL. THE IMAGINATION HAS NO SPEED LIMIT'
